//superclean.ca/fr/services/nettoyage-apres-evenement\"></head><body><a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a><div class=\"utility\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span>SUPERCLEAN CANADA INC.</span><a href=\"tel:+18338778737\">Let’s talk <span class=\"phone\">(833) 877-8737</span> ↗</a><a class=\"language-switch\" aria-label=\"Voir cette page en français\" lang=\"fr-CA\" hreflang=\"fr-CA\" href=\"/fr/services/nettoyage-apres-evenement\">FR</a></div></div><header class=\"header wrap\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"wordmark\" aria-label=\"Superclean home\"><img src=\"/assets/original-logo.png\" width=\"1680\" height=\"280\" alt=\"Superclean\"></a><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"main-nav\">Menu <span>☰</span></button><nav id=\"main-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><details class=\"services-nav\"><summary>Services <span aria-hidden=\"true\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"mega-menu\"><div class=\"mega-head\"><a href=\"/services#service-search\">Search all services ↗</a></div><div class=\"mega-groups\"><div><h2>Recurring &amp; everyday cleaning</h2><a href=\"/services/commercial-janitorial\">Commercial janitorial &amp; office cleaning</a><a href=\"/services/carpet-cleaning\">Carpet Cleaning</a><a href=\"/services/disinfecting\">Disinfecting</a><a class=\"mega-view\" href=\"/services#routine\">View category ↗</a></div><div><h2>Exterior &amp; building cleaning</h2><a href=\"/services/graffiti-removal\">Graffiti Removal</a><a href=\"/services/power-washing\">Power Washing</a><a href=\"/services/window-cleaning\">Window Cleaning</a><a class=\"mega-view\" href=\"/services#exterior\">View category ↗</a></div><div><h2>Specialty &amp; project cleaning</h2><a href=\"/services/mobile-vehicle-cleaning-and-detailing\">Mobile Vehicle Cleaning And Detailing</a><a href=\"/services/post-event-cleaning\">Post Event Cleaning</a><a href=\"/services/post-construction-cleaning\">Post Construction Cleaning</a><a class=\"mega-view\" href=\"/services#specialty\">View category ↗</a></div><div><h2>Waste &amp; disposal</h2><a href=\"/services/feminine-hygiene-disposal\">Sanitary &amp; feminine hygiene disposal</a><a href=\"/services/portable-toilet-cleaning\">Portable Toilet Cleaning</a><a href=\"/services/septic-tank-cleaning\">Septic Tank Cleaning</a><a class=\"mega-view\" href=\"/services#waste\">View category ↗</a></div><div><h2>Technical &amp; facility services</h2><a href=\"/services/duct-cleaning\">Duct Cleaning</a><a href=\"/services/exhaust-hood-cleaning\">Exhaust Hood Cleaning</a><a href=\"/services/chimney-cleaning\">Chimney Cleaning</a><a class=\"mega-view\" href=\"/services#technical\">View category ↗</a></div></div></div></details><a class=\"\" href=\"/industries\">Industries</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/locations\">Locations</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/products\">Products</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"/contact\">Request a quote <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></nav></header><nav class=\"breadcrumbs wrap\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><a class=\"\" href=\"/services\">Cleaning services</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Post Event Cleaning</span></nav><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-intro wrap split\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Specialty cleaning</p><h1>Post Event Cleaning</h1><p class=\"lede\">Cleaning plans for venues, shared spaces and event facilities.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"/contact?service=Post+Event+Cleaning\">Request a quote <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><figure><img src=\"/assets/photos/post-event-cleaning.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/photos/post-event-cleaning-640.webp 640w, /assets/photos/post-event-cleaning.webp 823w\" sizes=\"(max-width:800px) 100vw, 45vw\" width=\"720\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Collecting litter from grass after an event\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></figure></section><section class=\"section \"><div class=\"wrap\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">SERVICE SCOPE</p><h2>Turn the venue handover into a practical task list.</h2><div class=\"two-col\"><div><h3>Scope options to discuss</h3><ul class=\"checklist\"><li>Loose waste collection in agreed zones</li><li>Washrooms and event touchpoints</li><li>Floor care matched to venue finishes</li><li>Reset of accessible public and back-of-house areas</li></ul></div><div><h3>Agree these items separately</h3><p>Catering equipment, event dismantling, furniture relocation, waste transport and damage repair need separate ownership and pricing.</p><p class=\"small\">Your written quote defines the included tasks, exclusions and responsibilities.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section pale\"><div class=\"wrap\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">ACCESS & SCHEDULING</p><h2>Fit the work around your facility.</h2><div class=\"two-col\"><div><h3>Timing and access</h3><p>Share event finish time, vendor strike periods and the venue handover deadline. Identify zones released early and any access that must remain available for load-out.</p></div><div><h3>Before the site assessment</h3><p>Provide venue layout, attendance estimate, food-service areas and waste streams. Include the acceptance checklist, loading contact and responsibility for bins and consumables.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section \"><div class=\"wrap\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">SERVICE QUESTIONS</p><h2>Before you request a quote.</h2><div class=\"faqs\"><details><summary>Can cleaning begin while vendors are still leaving?</summary><p>Identify which zones are released and who controls the load-out route. Work sequencing must be agreed so cleaning is not immediately undone by further event activity.</p></details><details><summary>Is taking waste away included?</summary><p>State the material, estimated volume and available on-site collection points. Collection within the venue and off-site transport are separate scope decisions.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"section pale\"><div class=\"wrap\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR SERVICE, YOUR CITY</p><h2>Plan this service for your location.</h2><form class=\"city-finder\" action=\"/contact\" method=\"get\" data-local-routes=\"{&quot;Post Event Cleaning&quot;: {&quot;Toronto&quot;: &quot;/services/post-event-cleaning/toronto&quot;, &quot;North York&quot;: &quot;/services/post-event-cleaning/north-york&quot;, &quot;Mississauga&quot;: &quot;/services/post-event-cleaning/mississauga&quot;, &quot;Vaughan&quot;: &quot;/services/post-event-cleaning/vaughan&quot;}}\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"service\" value=\"Post Event Cleaning\"><label>City / market<select name=\"city\" required><option value=\"\">Choose your city</option><optgroup label=\"Ontario\"><option value=\"Toronto\">Toronto</option><option value=\"North York\">North York</option><option value=\"Ottawa\">Ottawa</option><option value=\"Hamilton\">Hamilton</option><option value=\"Kitchener\">Kitchener</option><option value=\"Cambridge\">Cambridge</option><option value=\"Waterloo\">Waterloo</option><option value=\"London\">London</option><option value=\"St. Catharines\">St. Catharines</option><option value=\"Niagara Falls\">Niagara Falls</option><option value=\"Oshawa\">Oshawa</option><option value=\"Windsor\">Windsor</option><option value=\"Barrie\">Barrie</option><option value=\"Kingston\">Kingston</option><option value=\"Guelph\">Guelph</option><option value=\"Brantford\">Brantford</option><option value=\"Peterborough\">Peterborough</option><option value=\"Greater Sudbury\">Greater Sudbury</option><option value=\"Thunder Bay\">Thunder Bay</option><option value=\"Belleville\">Belleville</option><option value=\"Quinte West\">Quinte West</option><option value=\"Mississauga\">Mississauga</option><option value=\"Brampton\">Brampton</option><option value=\"Markham\">Markham</option><option value=\"Vaughan\">Vaughan</option><option value=\"Richmond Hill\">Richmond Hill</option><option value=\"Oakville\">Oakville</option><option value=\"Burlington\">Burlington</option><optio